		(property "Description" "USB 2.0 Hi-Speed synchronous 245-mode FIFO bridge to Raspberry Pi 5 USB 3.0 port (device is USB2-speed, ~320 Mbps, backward compatible); self-powered over its own USB-C cable to the RPi5, not from the hub -- only the 13 FT245 sync-FIFO signal pins are wired here, the other 9 (3V out, 5V in, 2nd GND, C4-C9) are real pads on the new 2x11 board but intentionally unconnected"
